Decision: in `router-explorer.ts`, at the two `onRouteTriggered` wrap sites, forward own symbol properties from the inner handler to the wrapper. Small, generic, safe.

Actually — wait. Simpler alternative that avoids core changes entirely: in the ExpressAdapter, don't rely on the registered function identity. Instead, track at `applyVersionFilter`... no path. Hmm.

